    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Taylor & Chris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110417522072146987202/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJjf41iaPLpDZc3ps_PHigjyC_exNlW7hoHtaGfAh9udmBOPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t thank Carol enough for helping us when we were in the thick of our struggles with breastfeeding. She was able to come to our house quickly, and was incredibly supportive. With her help we were able to improve our technique and I also succeeded in increasing my milk supply! I can now feed my baby breastmilk exclusively and no longer have to supplement with formula. 1000% recommend for all new moms to work with a lactation consultant.",
        "time": 1765937919,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadine Eldokh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110527808174765273009/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrYrYI-39NjOunfIN6ru5DDCTeCRLzc_NnUNEjLY-dQRpbMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "An experienced and supportive lactation consultant. She helped me through my baby’s growth spurt and followed up to make sure everything was on track. I felt well supported and would definitely recommend her!",
        "time": 1766900064,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hafsa Khalid",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100720317552694742209/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKdSpOMeMGhvrUWHRFPCJPkd3Fjc5UaO4FuFH-iRnheeoRPag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I saw Carol after giving birth for some breastfeeding/latching issues and she was absolutely amazing! She was very helpful and explained everything in such a clear manner. The techniques she gave were tailored specifically to my baby and our situation/struggles. Within a few days of incorporating the techniques Carol mentioned, baby was able to successfully latch. Highly recommend seeing Carol if you are having any issues.",
        "time": 1749837487,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yro Kotsoros",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104090350813240298608/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzFv3Io0xjdIY3KN_sgzRKU0p41_jStn2lTaJOHu_In3we-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Carol was amazing and helped me achieve my goal. I’m beyond grateful for her help and would highly recommend her to any mom. I can’t thank her enough!",
        "time": 1766982000,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Negar Esfahani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101354563982054666316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJk5MzTlIJ1aLMU5210lG4XQwTrUCQqmKFpcMhwtR1mN7Samg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t thank Carol enough for the support and guidance she gave me during such a vulnerable time. Before working with her, I was struggling with breastfeeding and honestly felt defeated—I went from hating the experience to truly loving it, all because of her help. Carol is not only incredibly knowledgeable and professional, but also kind, compassionate, and patient. She made me feel seen, heard, and empowered every step of the way.\n\nWe had three sessions together, and each one was worth more than a hundred. She addressed all my concerns, tailored her advice to my baby’s and my specific needs, and made sure I felt confident moving forward. Carol is truly an angel and a gift to any new parent navigating the challenges of breastfeeding.\n\nThank you so much, Carol, for helping me enjoy this beautiful journey. I couldn’t have done it without you!",
        "time": 1742936267,
        "translated": false
      }
